OL,3,GNEWSAHow pickleball is changing our
OL,4,Alives
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith enough registered players to fill
OL,7,Fthe 20,000-seat O2 Arena, pickleball is
OL,8,Fthought to be one of England's
OL,9,Ffastest-growing sports.
OL,11,FClubs are springing up across the
OL,12,Fcountry, with groups highly
OL,13,Fconcentrated in big cities such as
OL,14,FLondon and Manchester.
OL,16,FBut the sport is taking hold in rural
OL,17,Fareas too, and players say it is
OL,18,Fchanging their lives.
